"><Properties><string name="Name">ServiceClearance</string><string name="Value">Central door approach X=-6..6 remains open. Rack fronts remain clear at floor level; fan-coil occupies only the right-side bay. Floor markings are visual labels, not collision barriers.</string></Properties></Item></Item></Item></Item><Item class="Model" referent="RBX00000000000000000000000070000324"><Properties><string name="Name">Engineering_Rework_V9</string></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX00000000000000000000000070000325"><Properties><string name="Name">README</string><string name="Value">V9 engineering rework: physical main structures, hollow cases, modeled internals, service doors/drawers, maintenance access and working NIF amplifier cutoff. Original main architecture and three legacy controllers are retained; V7/V8 prototype equipment is deliberately rebuilt.</string></Properties></Item><Item class="Model" referent="RBX00000000000000000000000070000326"><Properties><string name="Name">E07_Serviceable_V9</string></Properties><Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX00000000000000000000000070000327"><Properties><string name="Name">EngineeringScope</string><string name="Value">Replanned east bench X=-35.9..-30.7 leaves a 4.1-stud aisle to the original desk. Hollow analyzer, two optical heads and a split-door floor rack have modeled internals. The original V6 dock, workstation, cabinet and west entrance are preserved.</string></Properties></Item><Item class="Model" referent="RBX00000000000000000000000070000328"><Properties><string name="Name">LAB_CAL_02_PhysicalBench</string></Properties><Item class="Part" referent="RBX00000000000000000000000070000329"><Properties><string name="Name">LaboratoryCountertop</string><Vector3 name="size"><X>5.2</X><Y>0.26</Y><Z>11.4</Z></Vector3><CoordinateFrame name="CFrame"><X>-33.3</X><Y>-60.75</Y><Z>-49.4</Z><R00>1</R00><R01>0</R01><R02>0</R02><R10>0</R10><R11>1</R11><R12>0</R12><R20>-0</R20><R21>0</R21><R22>1</R22></CoordinateFrame><b